LLM Compressor attribution
==========================

This product includes software developed in association with the vLLM Project (https://github.com/vllm-project).

LLM Compressor is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0:
https://github.com/vllm-project/llm-compressor

OSFP4 installs LLM Compressor as a dependency and imports its modifier,
observer, calibration, and architecture-mapping interfaces. The LLM Compressor
Python package is not bundled in this distribution.

The OSFP4 smooth-layer mapping resolver was adapted from LLM Compressor's
SmoothQuant mapping-resolution logic. OSFP4 modifications include selected-layer
coverage checks, empty-match handling, and OSFP4 mapping objects. The resolver
is in src/llmcompressor_osfp4/modifiers/base.py.

OSFP4 code provenance
====================

The modifier, observer, examples, and tests were extracted from the OSFP4
implementation in https://github.com/neriahbd/llmcompressor-osfp4 into this
standalone plugin in commit 9ef44493d327c76d11aa4614898a35ba0e8e160f.

